  "observations": [
    "search_bounds scans absolute numeric literal values, including denominators, and caps its scale at 20000. Both 10000 and 1/10000 contain literal 10000.",
    "The existing coordinate transform writes OnSegment(...)/((s)**1). rational_constant supports +,-,*,/ but not Pow, so zero_test_call cannot unwrap this denominator.",
    "necessary_incidence_residuals only adds an oriented-area equation when zero_test_call recognizes OnSegment. The original public equations are retained; the additional numerical equations can disappear.",
    "These are observed changes to the evaluated representation, not an isolated causal decomposition of outcome differences. Fixedbox only intervenes on inferred search bounds."
